 in a week off two single readings. That's noise until you weigh in more often.\nWatch: only Oct 16 synced. 4,078 steps (standard 7,500), 45 active kcal, RHR 70, HRV 44, VO2 max 33.3, which is low for 29. Sleep not recorded.","wins":["Bench up ~17 lb e1RM in 16 days: 155x12 to 185x9, and 185x8 held today.","Chin-ups and pulldowns are getting done: 3x8-10 chin-ups and 2x12 at 88 lb on neutral pulldown today.","You finished a stair-climber block in every session you did (5-10 min)."],"misses":["Sessions: 2/5 this week, 1/5 last week.","Legs: 0 lower-body sessions in 14 days. Lower · Strength last done Oct 2, Legs · Muscle Oct 3 (17 min, 5 sets).","Rep ranges ignored: bench is prescribed 4x3-5 @RPE 8; you did 6 sets of 4-10 at RPE 10. Rows prescribed 5x5-7; you did 5x8-10.","Barbell row regressed: 145x8 (Oct 12) to 115x10 (Oct 17), e1RM ~184 to ~153.","Seated DB press regressed: 27.5x12x3 to 20x10x3. Barbell OHP was the prescribed lift and wasn't done.","Skipped prescribed accessories today: hammer curl + overhead triceps extension (swapped for incline curl, no triceps work).","Session length 70 min vs 60 target.","Nutrition: 1/7 days logged. Logged day: 327 kcal, 33 g protein (~170 g target). Fruit/veg: not logged.","Weigh-ins: 1 this week. Need 3+ to read a trend.","Steps: 4,078 on the one day synced (target 7,500). 6 days not synced.","Sleep: not logged.","Logging errors: neutral pulldown set 3 at 0 lb; chin-up load jumped from 30 to 60 with no note on whether that's added or assisted weight.","Progress photos: none."],"changes":["Removed Smith machine bench (3x8-12) from Upper · Strength. You already bench barbell first; the second flat press made today 70 min and added nothing new. Session should land near 60 min now.","Added a 10-15 min stair-climber finisher to Pull · Muscle. VO2 max is 33.3; you're already doing short blocks, this makes it prescribed and longer on your shortest day.","Kept 5 days. You've missed more than half two weeks running, but the fix is showing up, not a smaller plan. Your next session in the app is Lower · Strength. Do it."],"focus":["Hit 5 sessions, and do both leg days first: Lower · Strength next, Legs · Muscle within 3 days of it. No upper session until Lower · Strength is logged.","Use the prescribed ranges: bench 4x3-5 and row 5x5-7 at RPE 8. That means 1-2 reps left in the tank, not grinding to failure. Start bench at 195-200 for 4x4 and row at 135 for 5x6.","Log food every day. Hit 150+ g protein minimum, aiming for ~170. One shake isn't a day of eating.","Weigh in 3 mornings this week (same conditions: after bathroom, before food) and keep the Watch syncing daily, including sleep.","Take front, side and back photos this week: same spot, same light, morning."],"photos":"No progress photos on file. Take front, side and back this week under the same lighting and time of day. Without a baseline I can't tell you whether you're getting leaner or just heavier.","prev":{"plan":{"created":"2026-10-17","days":[{"name":"Upper · Strength","exercises":[{"ex":"bb-bench","sets":4,"lo":3,"hi":5,"rest":180,"rpe":8},{"ex":"bb-row","sets":5,"lo":5,"hi":7,"rest":150,"rpe":8},{"ex":"ohp","sets":3,"lo":5,"hi":7,"rest":150,"rpe":8},{"ex":"neutral-pulldown","sets":3,"lo":6,"hi":10,"rest":120,"rpe":8},{"ex":"hammer-curl","sets":2,"lo":8,"hi":12,"rest":60,"rpe":9,"ss":1},{"ex":"oh-tri-ext","sets":2,"lo":8,"hi":12,"rest":60,"rpe":9,"ss":1},{"ex":"stair-climber","sets":1,"lo":10,"hi":30,"rest":0},{"ex":"smith-bench","sets":3,"lo":8,"hi":12,"rest":90},{"ex":"chinup","sets":3,"lo":8,"hi":12,"rest":90}]},{"name":"Lower · Strength","exercises":[{"ex":"bb-squat","sets":4,"lo":3,"hi":5,"rest":180,"rpe":8},{"ex":"rdl","sets":3,"lo":5,"hi":8,"rest":150,"rpe":8},{"ex":"bulgarian","sets":3,"lo":6,"hi":10,"rest":90,"rpe":8},{"ex":"leg-curl","sets":3,"lo":8,"hi":12,"rest":75,"rpe":9,"ss":1},{"ex":"calf-raise","sets":3,"lo":8,"hi":12,"rest":60,"rpe":9,"ss":1},{"ex":"hanging-knee","sets":3,"lo":10,"hi":15,"rest":60,"rpe":9}]},{"na